<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:lang="lzh"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>瘋婦投河</title><title type="alternate">Feng fu tou he [A Woman in Distress and Her Rescue]</title><author>圖說未見署名，畫款另記</author><respStmt><resp>整理與編碼</resp><name>曲宸宇 (Chu, Chen-Yu)</name></respStmt></titleStmt><editionStmt><edition>Transcription dataset v0.2.0</edition></editionStmt><publicationStmt><p>曲宸宇 (Chu, Chen-Yu). Dataset edition 0.2.0.</p></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>點石齋畫報</title><date when="1886">1886，辛二第9圖</date><idno>L.sin. K 175-1/10 / bsb00075644, scan 735, 辛二第9圖</idno><ref target="https://www.digitale-sammlungen.de/en/view/bsb00075644?page=735">巴伐利亞邦立圖書館</ref></bibl></sourceDesc></fileDesc></teiHeader><facsimile><surface n="735" xml:id="original-page"><graphic url="https://api.digitale-sammlungen.de/iiif/image/v3/bsb00075644_00735/full/2600,/0/default.jpg" /></surface></facsimile><text><body><div type="article"><pb n="735" facs="#original-page" /><head>瘋婦投河</head><p><lb n="right-1" />京華地安門外後門<lb n="right-2" />橋下<lb n="right-3" />水深不及一尺而淤<lb n="right-4" />泥之<lb n="right-5" />深可沒足踝日前有<lb n="right-6" />一瘋<lb n="right-7" />婦卸去衣服入河亂<lb n="right-8" />滾怒<lb n="right-9" />罵嬉咲不知臭穢子年<lb n="right-10" />已及<lb n="right-11" />十六七見母如此無限<lb n="right-12" />哀痛<lb n="right-13" />求人襄助掖之以起<lb n="right-14" />而婦<lb n="right-15" />且極力蹲伏不肯出<lb n="right-16" />嗚呼<lb n="right-17" />犯此病者真是現在<lb n="right-18" />地獄</p><note type="artist-signature" n="圖右下畫款">桂作</note><note type="artist-seal" n="畫款下一方印">桂</note><note type="printer-seal" n="圖說末一方印">□□可□</note><note type="form-mark" n="同幅原刊圖號">九</note><note type="form-mark" n="同幅原刊期碼">辛二</note></div></body></text></TEI>